title: Carets added below, by Alt+click, by Ctrl+D and by Ctrl+Shift+L type together, undo as one step, Esc leaves one
folders: edit-carets
limit: 60
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: no file is being edited
forbid-log: no command is on the keys
expect-log: editing with 3 carets
expect-log: editing with 4 carets
expect-log: editing with 2 carets
expect-log: saved .*carets\.ts
expect-file: edit-carets/carets.ts :: (?-i)\A//const w = 10;\n//const height = 20;\n//const depth = 30;\nlet surface = w \* height\nlet volume = surface \* depth \+ w;\n\z

wait 3000
goto carets.ts
wait 1200
tool edit
edit carets.ts 1 1
press ctrl+alt+down
press ctrl+alt+down
type //
caret 4 1
key end
type !
wait 300
mark four-carets
wait 500
key undo
key escape
key backspace
wait 300
mark one-caret-again
wait 500
edit carets.ts 4 6
press ctrl+d
press ctrl+d
wait 300
mark two-areas
wait 500
type surface
edit carets.ts 1 10
press ctrl+shift+l
wait 300
mark every-width
wait 500
type w
wait 300
mark typed
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
